eractions determine the unique properties of water; doi:10.1080/0144235x.2016.1200347|Potential energy surfaces from high fidelity fitting of ab initio points: the permutation invariant polynomial - neural network approach; doi:10.1103/physrevb.87.184115|On representing chemical environments; doi:10.1103/physrevb.90.104108|Accuracy and transferability of Gaussian approximation potential models for tungsten; doi:10.1103/physrevlett.108.058301|Fast and accurate modeling of molecular atomization energies with machine learning.; doi:10.1103/physrevlett.117.135502|Machine Learning Energies of 2 Million Elpasolite (ABC_{2}D_{6}) Crystals.; doi:10.1103/physrevlett.98.146401|Generalized neural-network representation of high-dimensional potential-energy surfaces.; doi:10.1126/science.247.4945.978|Regularization Algorithms for Learning That Are Equivalent to Multilayer Networks; doi:10.1177/0269881113482532|Amphetamine, past and present – a pharmacological and clinical perspective; doi:10.5555/2627435.2670313|Dropout: a simple way to prevent neural networks from overfitting; title:arxiv 1412 6980:-|arXiv:1412.6980; title:deep learning:-|Deep Learning; title:s3 s7 53 d j heal s:-|, S3 – S7. 53 D. J. Heal, S.}
